  "instructions": [
    "In a large pot, heat the olive oil over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until it is softened and translucent.",
    "Stir in the smoked paprika, ground cumin, salt, and black pepper, and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the red lentils, vegetable broth, and water to the pot, and bring to a boil.",
    "Reduce the heat to low and simmer, covered, for 30 minutes, or until the lentils are tender.",
    "Use an immersion blender to puree the soup until it is smooth.",
    "Stir in the lemon juice and adjust the seasoning as needed.",
    "Serve the mercimek corbasi hot, garnished with chopped fresh herbs if desired."
